  {
    "id": 4901007360010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\nクリスマスプレゼント、どうぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030090020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……！　俺が貰っていいのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　プロデューサーさんのために買ったので、\r\nプロデューサーさんにもらってほしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうな！　今開けてもいいかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ……！　はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0177",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "駄菓子か……！\r\nあれ、なんかいっぱい入ってないか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとくちプリン、きなこ棒、ラムネ、フルーツ味の餅……\r\nまだまだ出てくるな、すごいな！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ひとつだけスッゴくすっぱいガムもあります！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0177",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ロシアンルーレットか！\r\n想像しただけで口の中が酸っぱくなるな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんとあたし、\r\nどっちがすっぱいのを食べるかやってみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、負けないぞ\r\n飲み物も準備しておかないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あとはー……\r\nちっちゃいヨーグルトとおっきいヨーグルトと……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nおっきい方は一緒に食べてほしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あとあと、当たり付きのあめとグミもあります！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当にいっぱい選んでくれたんだな！\r\nこんなに貰っちゃっていいのかな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いいんですー！\r\nクリスマスは特別なので！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あっ、プロデューサーさん！\r\nこれ！　これも見てください！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007360110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "これは、絶対絶対ぜーったい！\r\nプロデューサーさんにあげようって思ってました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100736/4901007360110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、それは気になるな\r\n果穂は何を選んでくれたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
